 Hindu Children in Britain (StokeonTrent: Trentham Books, ); Hugh Tinker,

 The Banyan Tree: Overseas Emigrants from India, Pakistan, and Bangladesh (Oxford: Oxford University Press, ); Steven Vertovec,

 Hindu Trinidad: Religion, Ethnicity and Socioeconomic Change (London: Macmillan Caribbean, ); Raymond Brady Williams (ed.),

